 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "text": "Jacques knows his machine better than anyone.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-10-919-gil9h5.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.719
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "text": "In a year, he retires.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-22-277-7e8xwk.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.817
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "text": "And by 2030, twenty to thirty percent of technologists will retire too.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-27-972-zyhjbp.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.719,
   "speech": "And by twenty-thirty, twenty to thirty percent of technologists will retire too."
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "text": "Their know-how isn't written down anywhere.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-31-656-vzx3qn.wav",
   "gap_after": 1.724
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "text": "Meet Clip.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-07-59-574-bv7tzn.wav",
   "gap_after": 1.196,
   "speech": "Meet… Clip."
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "text": "Film the expert while he explains. Clip records it all, right on the phone.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-37-048-xb1g99.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.698
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "text": "Add photos, a voice note, or your old procedures in PDF and Word.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-50-008-piff70.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.698
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "text": "Then, with a single button, AI writes the work instruction.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-54-243-fvsswz.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.698
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "text": "One action per step, the right video clip, the warnings at the right time.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-59-613-cf0x0d.wav",
   "gap_after": 1.196
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "text": "Edit with a word. Annotate with a click. Translate in seconds.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-05-929-paj103.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.66
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "text": "And your old instructions? Drop them in by the dozen, and they come out modernized.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-18-552-q2w8us.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.794
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "text": "Get it approved, then deploy it to the workstation, on a tablet or by QR code, no account needed.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-23-837-hn19i3.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.24
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "text": "The operator follows each step, hears it read aloud, and flags what isn't clear.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-13-24-309-e1xwlm.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.411
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "text": "And with one click, it exports to PDF.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-33-199-kpy03x.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.48
  },
  {
   "id": "v15",
   "text": "Clip. Your experts' know-how, at the workstation, in minutes.",
   "url": "https://ii-file.tor1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Audio-IA/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-41-459-mzab5n.wav",
   "gap_after": 0.49
  },
